Vendored from the postmarketOS aarch64 package so the image builds without
network access to the pmOS mirror. The APK also ships /usr/share/qcom userspace
(acdb calibration and DSP libraries) for pmOS's hexagonrpc; Armada's own
hexagonrpc payload is used instead, so only usr/lib/firmware was copied.
